## Bevy version

0.12

## What you did

loaded [this](http://peer.decentraland.org/content/contents/bafybeifckjgovqokmkh22q36dy2wnfinr3oemky6zun4ci4k5o5jobub7y) skinned mesh and modified it's translation as +1x per second (nb the file needs to be renamed to `something.glb`)

## What went wrong

it mostly works, but a couple of vertices seem to only partly respect the translation.

i see the same behaviour with several other meshes so i don't think it's anything particular about this mesh. i didn't see this problem in 0.11.3.

